description:
Hello, our name is Customertimes, but you can call us CT. We are a global digital engineering, product development, and technology consulting company. Headquartered in New York, we have a team of 1000\\+ experts working across 65\\+ countries.










 Location: Remote










***How you'll make an impact:***



* Design and develop scalable Salesforce solutions using Apex, LWC, OmniStudio, and Flow;
* Build and maintain OmniStudio solutions, including OmniScripts, FlexCards, DataRaptors, and Integration Procedures;
* Translate business requirements into scalable OmniStudio\\-based solutions and guided workflows;
* Develop Apex solutions, including triggers, classes, Batch, Queueable, and Scheduled Apex;
* Develop and maintain Lightning Web Components (LWC);
* Design and maintain integrations with external systems using REST/SOAP APIs;
* Optimize OmniStudio components and Salesforce solutions for performance and maintainability;
* Participate in technical design, estimation, code reviews, and troubleshooting;
* Write unit tests and follow Salesforce development best practices;
* Manage deployments using Git, SFDX, and CI/CD tools;
* Document solutions and mentor less experienced developers.









***What makes you a great fit:***



* 4\\+ years of Salesforce development experience;
* Strong hands\\-on production experience with OmniStudio;
* Practical experience with OmniScripts, FlexCards, DataRaptors, and Integration Procedures;
* Strong Apex development skills and understanding of asynchronous processing;
* Strong LWC development experience;
* Solid understanding of Salesforce data model, security model, and governor limits;
* Experience with Flow and declarative Salesforce automation;
* Experience with REST/SOAP integrations;
* Strong understanding of Salesforce development best practices, including bulkification, testing, and performance optimization;
* Experience with Git, SFDX/VS Code, and Salesforce deployments;
* Ability to work independently and take ownership of solutions;
* ***Preferred availability: 9 AM – 3 PM EST.***



 If you're looking to contribute to global projects, grow your skills, shape the way you work, and be part of a connected international community — Customertimes is the place to build your next career chapter. Are you ready to spark the tech with us?




**JR\\-205854**
